# ST15 (generalization): ST14 recipe (OPPCH 0.50 + ENT 0.016 + ST3..ST11 frozen
# finals in EXTRA_OPPS + Megabyte @ w2.0 via indococo-train-mega2) with two changes:
# (1) GAL_WEIGHT 3.0 (was 2.5) — ST12 finals Gal 25.0% missed gate vs ST11 30.0%;
#     slightly more Galactus league pressure to recover Gal panel without dropping Mega.
# (2) add ST12_final @ w1.0 to EXTRA_OPPS so training sees the latest non-promoted
#     ST12 style (pool/FR4-strong, Gal-weak) as an opponent. flip_reset 70.
# From ST14 best. Hypothesis: modest Gal weight bump + ST12_final in the league
# improves Gal/gen_panel without regressing pool/bp5 after ST12's narrow pool miss.
